    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>&quot; Sounds familiar, doesn\u2019t it?</i> </strong><br><br><strong><i>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Maybe you\u2019ve been here before.</i>  </strong><br><br><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Maybe you never left. &quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547980/extras/0658ed9c6547fe17876b96e233cd3db7.avif?t=1755619862\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to detect anomalies in places trapped in a loop. <br>If you can win all three games, you will receive what you desire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into an intense and mind-bending psychological thriller experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547980/extras/9df1a72847dafbaaa6f30136ccc695a0.avif?t=1755619862\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547980/extras/bf73258efa44755f1bd519c870a78dfd.poster.avif?t=1755619862\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547980/extras/bf73258efa44755f1bd519c870a78dfd.webm?t=1755619862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547980/extras/bf73258efa44755f1bd519c870a78dfd.mp4?t=1755619862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Examine the starting floor carefully and enter any door. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>On other floors, look around closely. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Anything different from the ground floor is considered an anomaly.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547980/extras/e9ac8c4e92eaef11de32add930e4e372.avif?t=1755619862\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547980/extras/5415a879ab38a80f969c2a14c3a8cf64.poster.avif?t=1755619862\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547980/extras/5415a879ab38a80f969c2a14c3a8cf64.webm?t=1755619862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547980/extras/5415a879ab38a80f969c2a14c3a8cf64.mp4?t=1755619862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>If it\u2019s safe, return. If not... run! Or maybe\u2026 it's already too late?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose wisely. Each wrong choice sends you back to the ground floor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Game Introduction</strong></u><br>They\u2019re dying.<br>I'm ready to give everything to save my wife and our unborn child!<br>I will accept the devil\u2019s offer to save them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547980/extras/bbd5030fca150f804f70f0790309ea89.avif?t=1755619862\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A suspenseful experience enhanced by atmospheric sound design and visual details.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 different maps (3rd map in full version)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >90+ anomalies</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>&quot; Sounds familiar, doesn\u2019t it?</i> </strong><br><br><strong><i>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Maybe you\u2019ve been here before.</i>  </strong><br><br><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Maybe you never left. &quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547980/extras/0658ed9c6547fe17876b96e233cd3db7.avif?t=1755619862\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to detect anomalies in places trapped in a loop. <br>If you can win all three games, you will receive what you desire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into an intense and mind-bending psychological thriller experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547980/extras/9df1a72847dafbaaa6f30136ccc695a0.avif?t=1755619862\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547980/extras/bf73258efa44755f1bd519c870a78dfd.poster.avif?t=1755619862\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547980/extras/bf73258efa44755f1bd519c870a78dfd.webm?t=1755619862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547980/extras/bf73258efa44755f1bd519c870a78dfd.mp4?t=1755619862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Examine the starting floor carefully and enter any door. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>On other floors, look around closely. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Anything different from the ground floor is considered an anomaly.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547980/extras/e9ac8c4e92eaef11de32add930e4e372.avif?t=1755619862\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547980/extras/5415a879ab38a80f969c2a14c3a8cf64.poster.avif?t=1755619862\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547980/extras/5415a879ab38a80f969c2a14c3a8cf64.webm?t=1755619862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547980/extras/5415a879ab38a80f969c2a14c3a8cf64.mp4?t=1755619862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>If it\u2019s safe, return. If not... run! Or maybe\u2026 it's already too late?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose wisely. Each wrong choice sends you back to the ground floor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Game Introduction</strong></u><br>They\u2019re dying.<br>I'm ready to give everything to save my wife and our unborn child!<br>I will accept the devil\u2019s offer to save them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547980/extras/bbd5030fca150f804f70f0790309ea89.avif?t=1755619862\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A suspenseful experience enhanced by atmospheric sound design and visual details.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 different maps (3rd map in full version)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >90+ anomalies</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
